<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS starts managed care stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS starts managed care stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Christine Bennis initiated coverage of managed healthcare stocks.</p>
<p>-- The analyst put buy ratings on WellPoint Health Networks Inc, Physicians Health Services Inc, and Oxford Health Plans.</p>
<p>-- She put holds on Healthsource Inc and United Healthcare Corp.</p>
</text>
